`[[task.heading.number]]` scopes one counter with `type` selectors (ADR-0010).
The pass publishes three public fields (ADR-0016): `number.raw` — the array of
counters, one string per depth — `number.depth` and `number.type`. It never
renders them; the component's `{...attrs}` spread prints all three.

